OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners voice concerns over
OL,4,Anew water councils
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have questioned whether new
OL,7,Fcouncils set up to give the public a
OL,8,Fsay over how water companies invest in
OL,9,Ftheir area will be effective.
OL,11,FEight Regional Water Councils were
OL,12,Fannounced by the government on
OL,13,FThursday, including one that covers
OL,14,FYorkshire.
OL,16,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said the
OL,17,Fcouncils would mean decisions about the
OL,18,Fwater system which are currently made
OL,19,Fnationally will instead be made
OL,20,Flocally.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
