OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners voice concerns over
OL,4,Anew water councils
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Water said it supported
OL,7,F"giving communities and regional
OL,8,Fleaders a stronger voice in decisions"
OL,9,Fbut the Ilkley Clean River Group (ICRG)
OL,10,Fsaid it fears the councils will end up
OL,11,Ftaking the blame for failures.
